TEXTC00016899TEXT-00001F3XA1. The $7,047.52 deposit was from the US Postmaster. Report amended.  2. Balance corrected  3. Totals corrected  4. Totals corrected  5. None of these transfers were used for activities prohibited by 11 CFR 300.34. We maintain separate accounts and track expenses to ensure we are in compliance.  6. All transfers complied with the 70-day time period. The first two transfers in October covered vendor expenses paid in September.  7.Salary entry corrected. It was not FEA.  8. Data Entry error corrected. Caroline Wagner was paid on 11/19. Her check was reported lost and a replacement check issued on 12/6. Schedule corrected to H4 supporting Line 21A.  
